OL,4,B'I am not a magician' - what can       
OL,5,BMaresca's Man City learn from          
OL,6,Bwatertight Arsenal?                    
OL,7,GManchester City's leaky defence faces  
OL,8,Gone of its most difficult tasks of the 
OL,9,Gseason with a trip to watertight       
OL,10,GArsenal, aiming to put right their     
OL,11,Gpatchy recent form.                    
OL,13,FEnzo Maresca's side began the season   
OL,14,Fwith eight straight victories but have 
OL,15,Fwon only one of their past seven in    
OL,16,Fall competitions inside 90 minutes and 
OL,17,Fhead to Emirates Stadium trailing the  
OL,18,Fchampions by six points even at this   
OL,19,Fearly juncture.                        
